    "group": "Shield Host",
    "summary": "At the start of each battle round, you may pick one of two effects to last until the next battle round starts. The first lets melee attacks by your ADEPTUS CUSTODES models that have Martial Ka'tah score a Critical Hit on any unmodified 5+ Hit roll. The second improves the Armour Penetration of those models' melee weapons by 1.",
